    {
      "id": "the-merchant-of-venice/sceneIII_22.1/p@73780",
      "type": "stage",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "scenedesc"
      ],
      "text": "Enter Solanio and Salarino.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [
        {
          "tag": "span",
          "start": 6,
          "end": 13,
          "className": "charname"
        },
        {
          "tag": "span",
          "start": 18,
          "end": 26,
          "className": "charname"
        }
      ],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "the-merchant-of-venice/sceneIII_22.1/p@73780/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 27,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 3957776,
        "end": 3957889,
        "line": 146242,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap22/p@73780",
        "anchor": "sceneIII_22.1"
      },
      "speakerLabel": null,
      "attribution": {
        "status": "not-applicable"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "the-merchant-of-venice/sceneIII_22.1/p@73897",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "SOLANIO.\nNow, what news on the Rialto?",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "the-merchant-of-venice/sceneIII_22.1/p@73897/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 8,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "the-merchant-of-venice/sceneIII_22.1/p@73897/line-2",
          "start": 9,
          "end": 38,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 3957893,
        "end": 3957961,
        "line": 146245,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap22/p@73897",
        "anchor": "sceneIII_22.1"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "SOLANIO.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 8
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "the-merchant-of-venice/sceneIII_22.1/p@73969",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "SALARINO.\nWhy, yet it lives there unchecked that Antonio hath a ship of rich lading wrack’d on the narrow seas; the Goodwins, I think they call the place, a very dangerous flat and fatal, where the carcasses of many a tall ship lie buried, as they say, if my gossip Report be an honest woman of her word.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "the-merchant-of-venice/sceneIII_22.1/p@73969/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 9,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "the-merchant-of-venice/sceneIII_22.1/p@73969/line-2",
          "start": 10,
          "end": 304,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 3957965,
        "end": 3958302,
        "line": 146250,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap22/p@73969",
        "anchor": "sceneIII_22.1"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "SALARINO.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 9
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "the-merchant-of-venice/sceneIII_22.1/p@74310",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "SOLANIO.\nI would she were as lying a gossip in that as ever knapped ginger or made her neighbours believe she wept for the death of a third husband. But it is true, without any slips of prolixity or crossing the plain highway of talk, that the good Antonio, the honest Antonio,—O that I had a title good enough to keep his name company!—",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "the-merchant-of-venice/sceneIII_22.1/p@74310/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 8,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "the-merchant-of-venice/sceneIII_22.1/p@74310/line-2",
          "start": 9,
          "end": 337,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 3958306,
        "end": 3958677,
        "line": 146258,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap22/p@74310",
        "anchor": "sceneIII_22.1"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "SOLANIO.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 8
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "the-merchant-of-venice/sceneIII_22.1/p@74685",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "SALARINO.\nCome, the full stop.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "the-merchant-of-venice/sceneIII_22.1/p@74685/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 9,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "the-merchant-of-venice/sceneIII_22.1/p@74685/line-2",
          "start": 10,
          "end": 30,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 3958681,
        "end": 3958741,
        "line": 146267,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap22/p@74685",
        "anchor": "sceneIII_22.1"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "SALARINO.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 9
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "the-merchant-of-venice/sceneIII_22.1/p@74749",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "SOLANIO.\nHa, what sayest thou? Why, the end is, he hath lost a ship.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "the-merchant-of-venice/sceneIII_22.1/p@74749/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 8,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "the-merchant-of-venice/sceneIII_22.1/p@74749/line-2",
          "start": 9,
          "end": 68,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 3958745,
        "end": 3958843,
        "line": 146272,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap22/p@74749",
        "anchor": "sceneIII_22.1"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "SOLANIO.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 8
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "the-merchant-of-venice/sceneIII_22.1/p@74851",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "SALARINO.\nI would it might prove the end of his losses.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "the-merchant-of-venice/sceneIII_22.1/p@74851/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 9,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "the-merchant-of-venice/sceneIII_22.1/p@74851/line-2",
          "start": 10,
          "end": 55,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 3958847,
        "end": 3958932,
        "line": 146277,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap22/p@74851",
        "anchor": "sceneIII_22.1"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "SALARINO.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 9
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "the-merchant-of-venice/sceneIII_22.1/p@74940",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "SOLANIO.\nLet me say “amen” betimes, lest the devil cross my prayer, for here he comes in the likeness of a Jew.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "the-merchant-of-venice/sceneIII_22.1/p@74940/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 8,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "the-merchant-of-venice/sceneIII_22.1/p@74940/line-2",
          "start": 9,
          "end": 111,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 3958936,
        "end": 3959078,
        "line": 146282,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap22/p@74940",
        "anchor": "sceneIII_22.1"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "SOLANIO.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 8
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "the-merchant-of-venice/sceneIII_22.1/p@75086",
      "type": "stage",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "scenedesc"
      ],
      "text": "Enter Shylock.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [
        {
          "tag": "span",
          "start": 6,
          "end": 13,
          "className": "charname"
        }
      ],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "the-merchant-of-venice/sceneIII_22.1/p@75086/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 14,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 3959082,
        "end": 3959151,
        "line": 146288,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap22/p@75086",
        "anchor": "sceneIII_22.1"
      },
      "speakerLabel": null,
      "attribution": {
        "status": "not-applicable"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "the-merchant-of-venice/sceneIII_22.1/p@75159",
      "type": "passage",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "How now, Shylock, what news among the merchants?",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "the-merchant-of-venice/sceneIII_22.1/p@75159/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 48,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 3959155,
        "end": 3959228,
        "line": 146290,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap22/p@75159",
        "anchor": "sceneIII_22.1"
      },
      "speakerLabel": null,
      "attribution": {
        "status": "source-unlabelled"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "the-merchant-of-venice/sceneIII_22.1/p@75236",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "SHYLOCK.\nYou knew, none so well, none so well as you, of my daughter’s flight.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "the-merchant-of-venice/sceneIII_22.1/p@75236/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 8,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "the-merchant-of-venice/sceneIII_22.1/p@75236/line-2",
          "start": 9,
          "end": 78,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 3959232,
        "end": 3959340,
        "line": 146294,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap22/p@75236",
        "anchor": "sceneIII_22.1"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "SHYLOCK.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 8
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "the-merchant-of-venice/sceneIII_22.1/p@75348",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "SALARINO.\nThat’s certain, I, for my part, knew the tailor that made the wings she flew withal.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "the-merchant-of-venice/sceneIII_22.1/p@75348/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 9,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "the-merchant-of-venice/sceneIII_22.1/p@75348/line-2",
          "start": 10,
          "end": 94,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 3959344,
        "end": 3959469,
        "line": 146299,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap22/p@75348",
        "anchor": "sceneIII_22.1"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "SALARINO.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 9
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "the-merchant-of-venice/sceneIII_22.1/p@75477",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "SOLANIO.\nAnd Shylock, for his own part, knew the bird was fledged; and then it is the complexion of them all to leave the dam.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "the-merchant-of-venice/sceneIII_22.1/p@75477/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 8,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "the-merchant-of-venice/sceneIII_22.1/p@75477/line-2",
          "start": 9,
          "end": 126,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 3959473,
        "end": 3959630,
        "line": 146305,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap22/p@75477",
        "anchor": "sceneIII_22.1"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "SOLANIO.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 8
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "the-merchant-of-venice/sceneIII_22.1/p@75638",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "SHYLOCK.\nShe is damn’d for it.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "the-merchant-of-venice/sceneIII_22.1/p@75638/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 8,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "the-merchant-of-venice/sceneIII_22.1/p@75638/line-2",
          "start": 9,
          "end": 30,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 3959634,
        "end": 3959694,
        "line": 146311,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap22/p@75638",
        "anchor": "sceneIII_22.1"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "SHYLOCK.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 8
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "the-merchant-of-venice/sceneIII_22.1/p@75702",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "SALARINO.\nThat’s certain, if the devil may be her judge.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "the-merchant-of-venice/sceneIII_22.1/p@75702/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 9,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "the-merchant-of-venice/sceneIII_22.1/p@75702/line-2",
          "start": 10,
          "end": 56,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 3959698,
        "end": 3959784,
        "line": 146316,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap22/p@75702",
        "anchor": "sceneIII_22.1"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "SALARINO.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 9
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "the-merchant-of-venice/sceneIII_22.1/p@75792",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "SHYLOCK.\nMy own flesh and blood to rebel!",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "the-merchant-of-venice/sceneIII_22.1/p@75792/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 8,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "the-merchant-of-venice/sceneIII_22.1/p@75792/line-2",
          "start": 9,
          "end": 41,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 3959788,
        "end": 3959859,
        "line": 146321,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap22/p@75792",
        "anchor": "sceneIII_22.1"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "SHYLOCK.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 8
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "the-merchant-of-venice/sceneIII_22.1/p@75867",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "SOLANIO.\nOut upon it, old carrion! Rebels it at these years?",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "the-merchant-of-venice/sceneIII_22.1/p@75867/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 8,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "the-merchant-of-venice/sceneIII_22.1/p@75867/line-2",
          "start": 9,
          "end": 60,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 3959863,
        "end": 3959953,
        "line": 146326,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap22/p@75867",
        "anchor": "sceneIII_22.1"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "SOLANIO.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 8
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "the-merchant-of-venice/sceneIII_22.1/p@75961",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "SHYLOCK.\nI say my daughter is my flesh and my blood.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "the-merchant-of-venice/sceneIII_22.1/p@75961/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 8,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "the-merchant-of-venice/sceneIII_22.1/p@75961/line-2",
          "start": 9,
          "end": 52,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 3959957,
        "end": 3960039,
        "line": 146331,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap22/p@75961",
        "anchor": "sceneIII_22.1"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "SHYLOCK.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 8
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "the-merchant-of-venice/sceneIII_22.1/p@76047",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "SALARINO.\nThere is more difference between thy flesh and hers than between jet and ivory, more between your bloods than there is between red wine and Rhenish. But tell us, do you hear whether Antonio have had any loss at sea or no?",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "the-merchant-of-venice/sceneIII_22.1/p@76047/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 9,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "the-merchant-of-venice/sceneIII_22.1/p@76047/line-2",
          "start": 10,
          "end": 231,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 3960043,
        "end": 3960306,
        "line": 146336,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap22/p@76047",
        "anchor": "sceneIII_22.1"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "SALARINO.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 9
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "the-merchant-of-venice/sceneIII_22.1/p@76314",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "SHYLOCK.\nThere I have another bad match, a bankrupt, a prodigal, who dare scarce show his head on the Rialto, a beggar that used to come so smug upon the mart; let him look to his bond. He was wont to call me usurer; let him look to his bond: he was wont to lend money for a Christian cur’sy; let him look to his bond.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "the-merchant-of-venice/sceneIII_22.1/p@76314/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 8,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "the-merchant-of-venice/sceneIII_22.1/p@76314/line-2",
          "start": 9,
          "end": 318,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 3960310,
        "end": 3960662,
        "line": 146343,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap22/p@76314",
        "anchor": "sceneIII_22.1"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "SHYLOCK.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 8
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "the-merchant-of-venice/sceneIII_22.1/p@76670",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "SALARINO.\nWhy, I am sure if he forfeit, thou wilt not take his flesh! What’s that good for?",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "the-merchant-of-venice/sceneIII_22.1/p@76670/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 9,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "the-merchant-of-venice/sceneIII_22.1/p@76670/line-2",
          "start": 10,
          "end": 91,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 3960666,
        "end": 3960788,
        "line": 146352,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap22/p@76670",
        "anchor": "sceneIII_22.1"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "SALARINO.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 9
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "the-merchant-of-venice/sceneIII_22.1/p@76796",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "SHYLOCK.\nTo bait fish withal; if it will feed nothing else, it will feed my revenge. He hath disgrac’d me and hind’red me half a million, laugh’d at my losses, mock’d at my gains, scorned my nation, thwarted my bargains, cooled my friends, heated mine enemies. And what’s his reason? I am a Jew. Hath not a Jew eyes? Hath not a Jew hands, organs, dimensions, senses, affections, passions? Fed with the same food, hurt with the same weapons, subject to the same diseases, healed by the same means, warmed and cooled by the same winter and summer as a Christian is? If you prick us, do we not bleed? If you tickle us, do we not laugh? If you poison us, do we not die? And if you wrong us, shall we not revenge? If we are like you in the rest, we will resemble you in that. If a Jew wrong a Christian, what is his humility? Revenge. If a Christian wrong a Jew, what should his sufferance be by Christian example? Why, revenge! The villainy you teach me I will execute, and it shall go hard but I will better the instruction.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "the-merchant-of-venice/sceneIII_22.1/p@76796/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 8,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "the-merchant-of-venice/sceneIII_22.1/p@76796/line-2",
          "start": 9,
          "end": 1021,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 3960792,
        "end": 3961856,
        "line": 146358,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap22/p@76796",
        "anchor": "sceneIII_22.1"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "SHYLOCK.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 8
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "the-merchant-of-venice/sceneIII_22.1/p@77864",
      "type": "stage",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "scenedesc"
      ],
      "text": "Enter a man from Antonio.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "the-merchant-of-venice/sceneIII_22.1/p@77864/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 25,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 3961860,
        "end": 3961910,
        "line": 146376,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap22/p@77864",
        "anchor": "sceneIII_22.1"
      },
      "speakerLabel": null,
      "attribution": {
        "status": "not-applicable"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "the-merchant-of-venice/sceneIII_22.1/p@77918",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "SERVANT.\nGentlemen, my master Antonio is at his house, and desires to speak with you both.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "the-merchant-of-venice/sceneIII_22.1/p@77918/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 8,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "the-merchant-of-venice/sceneIII_22.1/p@77918/line-2",
          "start": 9,
          "end": 90,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 3961914,
        "end": 3962035,
        "line": 146378,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap22/p@77918",
        "anchor": "sceneIII_22.1"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "SERVANT.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 8
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "the-merchant-of-venice/sceneIII_22.1/p@78043",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "SALARINO.\nWe have been up and down to seek him.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "the-merchant-of-venice/sceneIII_22.1/p@78043/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 9,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "the-merchant-of-venice/sceneIII_22.1/p@78043/line-2",
          "start": 10,
          "end": 47,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 3962039,
        "end": 3962116,
        "line": 146384,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap22/p@78043",
        "anchor": "sceneIII_22.1"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "SALARINO.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 9
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "the-merchant-of-venice/sceneIII_22.1/p@78124",
      "type": "stage",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "scenedesc"
      ],
      "text": "Enter Tubal.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [
        {
          "tag": "span",
          "start": 6,
          "end": 11,
          "className": "charname"
        }
      ],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "the-merchant-of-venice/sceneIII_22.1/p@78124/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 12,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 3962120,
        "end": 3962187,
        "line": 146389,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap22/p@78124",
        "anchor": "sceneIII_22.1"
      },
      "speakerLabel": null,
      "attribution": {
        "status": "not-applicable"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "the-merchant-of-venice/sceneIII_22.1/p@78195",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "SOLANIO.\nHere comes another of the tribe; a third cannot be match’d, unless the devil himself turn Jew.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "the-merchant-of-venice/sceneIII_22.1/p@78195/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 8,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "the-merchant-of-venice/sceneIII_22.1/p@78195/line-2",
          "start": 9,
          "end": 103,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 3962191,
        "end": 3962325,
        "line": 146391,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap22/p@78195",
        "anchor": "sceneIII_22.1"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "SOLANIO.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 8
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "the-merchant-of-venice/sceneIII_22.1/p@78333",
      "type": "passage",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "right"
      ],
      "text": "[Exeunt Solanio, Salarino and the Servant.]",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [
        {
          "tag": "span",
          "start": 8,
          "end": 25,
          "className": "charname"
        },
        {
          "tag": "span",
          "start": 34,
          "end": 41,
          "className": "charname"
        },
        {
          "tag": "i",
          "start": 1,
          "end": 42
        }
      ],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "the-merchant-of-venice/sceneIII_22.1/p@78333/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 43,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 3962329,
        "end": 3962461,
        "line": 146397,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap22/p@78333",
        "anchor": "sceneIII_22.1"
      },
      "speakerLabel": null,
      "attribution": {
        "status": "source-unlabelled"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "the-merchant-of-venice/sceneIII_22.1/p@78469",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "SHYLOCK.\nHow now, Tubal, what news from Genoa? Hast thou found my daughter?",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "the-merchant-of-venice/sceneIII_22.1/p@78469/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 8,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "the-merchant-of-venice/sceneIII_22.1/p@78469/line-2",
          "start": 9,
          "end": 75,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 3962465,
        "end": 3962570,
        "line": 146400,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap22/p@78469",
        "anchor": "sceneIII_22.1"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "SHYLOCK.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 8
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "the-merchant-of-venice/sceneIII_22.1/p@78578",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "TUBAL.\nI often came where I did hear of her, but cannot find her.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "the-merchant-of-venice/sceneIII_22.1/p@78578/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 6,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "the-merchant-of-venice/sceneIII_22.1/p@78578/line-2",
          "start": 7,
          "end": 65,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 3962574,
        "end": 3962669,
        "line": 146405,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap22/p@78578",
        "anchor": "sceneIII_22.1"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "TUBAL.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 6
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "the-merchant-of-venice/sceneIII_22.1/p@78677",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "SHYLOCK.\nWhy there, there, there, there! A diamond gone cost me two thousand ducats in Frankfort! The curse never fell upon our nation till now, I never felt it till now. Two thousand ducats in that, and other precious, precious jewels. I would my daughter were dead at my foot, and the jewels in her ear; would she were hearsed at my foot, and the ducats in her coffin. No news of them? Why so? And I know not what’s spent in the search. Why, thou—loss upon loss! The thief gone with so much, and so much to find the thief, and no satisfaction, no revenge, nor no ill luck stirring but what lights o’ my shoulders, no sighs but o’ my breathing, no tears but o’ my shedding.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "the-merchant-of-venice/sceneIII_22.1/p@78677/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 8,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "the-merchant-of-venice/sceneIII_22.1/p@78677/line-2",
          "start": 9,
          "end": 674,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 3962673,
        "end": 3963386,
        "line": 146410,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap22/p@78677",
        "anchor": "sceneIII_22.1"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "SHYLOCK.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 8
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "the-merchant-of-venice/sceneIII_22.1/p@79394",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "TUBAL.\nYes, other men have ill luck too. Antonio, as I heard in Genoa—",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "the-merchant-of-venice/sceneIII_22.1/p@79394/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 6,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "the-merchant-of-venice/sceneIII_22.1/p@79394/line-2",
          "start": 7,
          "end": 70,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 3963390,
        "end": 3963490,
        "line": 146424,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap22/p@79394",
        "anchor": "sceneIII_22.1"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "TUBAL.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 6
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "the-merchant-of-venice/sceneIII_22.1/p@79498",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "SHYLOCK.\nWhat, what, what? Ill luck, ill luck?",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "the-merchant-of-venice/sceneIII_22.1/p@79498/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 8,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "the-merchant-of-venice/sceneIII_22.1/p@79498/line-2",
          "start": 9,
          "end": 46,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 3963494,
        "end": 3963570,
        "line": 146429,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap22/p@79498",
        "anchor": "sceneIII_22.1"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "SHYLOCK.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 8
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "the-merchant-of-venice/sceneIII_22.1/p@79578",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "TUBAL.\n—hath an argosy cast away coming from Tripolis.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "the-merchant-of-venice/sceneIII_22.1/p@79578/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 6,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "the-merchant-of-venice/sceneIII_22.1/p@79578/line-2",
          "start": 7,
          "end": 54,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 3963574,
        "end": 3963658,
        "line": 146434,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap22/p@79578",
        "anchor": "sceneIII_22.1"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "TUBAL.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 6
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "the-merchant-of-venice/sceneIII_22.1/p@79666",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "SHYLOCK.\nI thank God! I thank God! Is it true, is it true?",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "the-merchant-of-venice/sceneIII_22.1/p@79666/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 8,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "the-merchant-of-venice/sceneIII_22.1/p@79666/line-2",
          "start": 9,
          "end": 58,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 3963662,
        "end": 3963750,
        "line": 146439,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap22/p@79666",
        "anchor": "sceneIII_22.1"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "SHYLOCK.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 8
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "the-merchant-of-venice/sceneIII_22.1/p@79758",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "TUBAL.\nI spoke with some of the sailors that escaped the wrack.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "the-merchant-of-venice/sceneIII_22.1/p@79758/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 6,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "the-merchant-of-venice/sceneIII_22.1/p@79758/line-2",
          "start": 7,
          "end": 63,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 3963754,
        "end": 3963847,
        "line": 146444,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap22/p@79758",
        "anchor": "sceneIII_22.1"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "TUBAL.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 6
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "the-merchant-of-venice/sceneIII_22.1/p@79855",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "SHYLOCK.\nI thank thee, good Tubal. Good news, good news! Ha, ha, heard in Genoa?",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "the-merchant-of-venice/sceneIII_22.1/p@79855/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 8,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "the-merchant-of-venice/sceneIII_22.1/p@79855/line-2",
          "start": 9,
          "end": 80,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 3963851,
        "end": 3963961,
        "line": 146449,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap22/p@79855",
        "anchor": "sceneIII_22.1"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "SHYLOCK.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 8
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "the-merchant-of-venice/sceneIII_22.1/p@79969",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "TUBAL.\nYour daughter spent in Genoa, as I heard, one night, fourscore ducats.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "the-merchant-of-venice/sceneIII_22.1/p@79969/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 6,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "the-merchant-of-venice/sceneIII_22.1/p@79969/line-2",
          "start": 7,
          "end": 77,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 3963965,
        "end": 3964072,
        "line": 146454,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap22/p@79969",
        "anchor": "sceneIII_22.1"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "TUBAL.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 6
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "the-merchant-of-venice/sceneIII_22.1/p@80080",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "SHYLOCK.\nThou stick’st a dagger in me. I shall never see my gold again. Fourscore ducats at a sitting! Fourscore ducats!",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
