      },
      "speakerLabel": "SHYLOCK.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 8
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "the-merchant-of-venice/sceneIII_22.1/p@80235",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "TUBAL.\nThere came divers of Antonio’s creditors in my company to Venice that swear he cannot choose but break.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "the-merchant-of-venice/sceneIII_22.1/p@80235/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 6,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "the-merchant-of-venice/sceneIII_22.1/p@80235/line-2",
          "start": 7,
          "end": 110,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 3964231,
        "end": 3964372,
        "line": 146465,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap22/p@80235",
        "anchor": "sceneIII_22.1"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "TUBAL.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 6
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "the-merchant-of-venice/sceneIII_22.1/p@80380",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "SHYLOCK.\nI am very glad of it. I’ll plague him, I’ll torture him. I am glad of it.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "the-merchant-of-venice/sceneIII_22.1/p@80380/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 8,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "the-merchant-of-venice/sceneIII_22.1/p@80380/line-2",
          "start": 9,
          "end": 82,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 3964376,
        "end": 3964489,
        "line": 146471,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap22/p@80380",
        "anchor": "sceneIII_22.1"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "SHYLOCK.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 8
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "the-merchant-of-venice/sceneIII_22.1/p@80497",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "TUBAL.\nOne of them showed me a ring that he had of your daughter for a monkey.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "the-merchant-of-venice/sceneIII_22.1/p@80497/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 6,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "the-merchant-of-venice/sceneIII_22.1/p@80497/line-2",
          "start": 7,
          "end": 78,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 3964493,
        "end": 3964601,
        "line": 146477,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap22/p@80497",
        "anchor": "sceneIII_22.1"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "TUBAL.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 6
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "the-merchant-of-venice/sceneIII_22.1/p@80609",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "SHYLOCK.\nOut upon her! Thou torturest me, Tubal. It was my turquoise, I had it of Leah when I was a bachelor. I would not have given it for a wilderness of monkeys.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "the-merchant-of-venice/sceneIII_22.1/p@80609/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 8,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "the-merchant-of-venice/sceneIII_22.1/p@80609/line-2",
          "start": 9,
          "end": 164,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 3964605,
        "end": 3964800,
        "line": 146482,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap22/p@80609",
        "anchor": "sceneIII_22.1"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "SHYLOCK.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 8
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "the-merchant-of-venice/sceneIII_22.1/p@80808",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "TUBAL.\nBut Antonio is certainly undone.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "the-merchant-of-venice/sceneIII_22.1/p@80808/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 6,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "the-merchant-of-venice/sceneIII_22.1/p@80808/line-2",
          "start": 7,
          "end": 39,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 3964804,
        "end": 3964873,
        "line": 146488,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap22/p@80808",
        "anchor": "sceneIII_22.1"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "TUBAL.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 6
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "the-merchant-of-venice/sceneIII_22.1/p@80881",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "SHYLOCK.\nNay, that’s true, that’s very true. Go, Tubal, fee me an officer; bespeak him a fortnight before. I will have the heart of him if he forfeit, for were he out of Venice I can make what merchandise I will. Go, Tubal, and meet me at our synagogue. Go, good Tubal, at our synagogue, Tubal.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "the-merchant-of-venice/sceneIII_22.1/p@80881/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 8,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "the-merchant-of-venice/sceneIII_22.1/p@80881/line-2",
          "start": 9,
          "end": 294,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 3964877,
        "end": 3965204,
        "line": 146493,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap22/p@80881",
        "anchor": "sceneIII_22.1"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "SHYLOCK.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 8
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "the-merchant-of-venice/sceneIII_22.1/p@81212",
      "type": "passage",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "right"
      ],
      "text": "[Exeunt.]",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
